{
  "info": {
    "name": "Quark Verifier - API + Credo Routes",
    "_postman_id": "e3beff57-a1d9-487d-b9f8-f171ea7d4f44",
    "description": "Verifier multi-tenant (QuarkID 2.0).\n\n**DIDComm request (invitar + pedir proof) — dos opciones:**\n- `POST .../didcomm/request (Ed25519)` — VC completa, proof Ed25519\n- `POST .../didcomm/request (BBS+ selective disclosure)` — solo revela paths del PD (p. ej. name); requiere VC emitida con offer BBS+\n\nLuego: pegá `invitation` en Holder `receive-invitation` → `GET .../didcomm/request/:pendingRequestId`.\n\nConvención (`setGlobalPrefix('v1')` + `@Controller`):\n- Admin: `/v1/verifiers`, records, OID4VP\n- Short URL: `/oob/:pendingRequestId`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
