              "raw": "{\n  \"keyId\": \"{{x5cLeafCertificateKeyId}}\",\n  \"privateJwk\": {\n    \"kty\": \"EC\",\n    \"crv\": \"P-256\",\n    \"x\": \"{{x5cPrivateJwkX}}\",\n    \"y\": \"{{x5cPrivateJwkY}}\",\n    \"d\": \"{{x5cPrivateJwkD}}\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{verifierBaseUrl}}/v1/domain-key",
            "description": "Importa la clave privada del cert leaf al KMS scope `domain-key`. **Directo al verifier** (`:9002` o tunnel), sin JWT ni gateway.\n\nCompletar `x5cPrivateJwkX/Y/D` en environment (secret) desde `local/certs/quark-verifier.key`:\n`node -e \"const c=require('crypto'),f=require('fs');console.log(JSON.stringify(c.createPrivateKey(f.readFileSync('local/certs/quark-verifier.key','utf8')).export({format:'jwk'})))\"`\n\n`keyId` debe coincidir con `OID4VP_X5C_LEAF_CERTIFICATE_KEY_ID` en el `.env` del verifier.\n\nVer `docs/soporte-eu-wallet/quark-verifier-x5c.md`."
          },
          "event": [
